  "description": {
    "en": "Wilson Duo Feel is a comfort- and feel-oriented hybrid combining Wilson NXT 16 / 1.30 mm with Luxilon Element 17 / 1.25 mm. NXT contributes power, pocketing and exceptional shock absorption, while Element adds controlled co-polyester response and stringbed stability without the harshness of firmer polyester strings. Wilson allows either string to be installed in the mains, enabling players to tune the setup toward more control or more comfort. For ideal playability, Wilson recommends reducing Luxilon Element tension by at least 10%.",

    "zh": "Wilson Duo Feel 是一套以 Feel、Comfort 和减震为核心的官方 Hybrid，由 Wilson NXT 16 / 1.30 毫米与 Luxilon Element 17 / 1.25 毫米组成。NXT 负责提供力量、Pocketing、柔和手感和优秀的 Shock Absorption；Luxilon Element 则提供聚酯所需要的方向支撑、控制和线床稳定性，但整体比传统偏硬聚酯更加柔和。两根球线都可以作为主线使用：Element 做主线时更加偏控制和稳定；NXT 做主线时则更加柔软、有力量并具有更明显的 Pocketing。Wilson 建议 Luxilon Element 的穿线张力至少降低 10%，以获得理想的可打性。"
  },

